    and activate 1 of these effects;\r\n\u25CF Special Summon 1 \"Enneacraft\" monster
    from your hand in face-down Defense Position.\r\n\u25CF Change 1 face-down Defense
    Position \"Enneacraft\" monster you control to face-up Defense Position.\r\nYou
    can only activate 1 \"Enneacraft Reverth\" per turn."
